# Review Notes

> **For future Claude**: This directory contains weekly and monthly review notes. All notes follow the `type: review` schema.

## Frontmatter Schema
```yaml
---
date: YYYY-MM-DD              # the date the review was generated
period-start: YYYY-MM-DD
period-end: YYYY-MM-DD
type: review                  # weekly | monthly
tags: [review, ...]
ai-first: true
---
```

## Note Structure
Each review note should contain:
- `## For future Claude` preamble
- `## Period` - Date range covered
- `## Shipped` - What was completed
- `## Decisions` - Decisions made during the period
- `## People` - Who was interacted with
- `## Patterns` - Emergent themes and insights
- `## Metrics` - Quantitative summary (optional)

## Naming Convention
- Weekly: `Week YYYY-Www.md` (e.g., `Week 2026-W31.md`)
- Monthly: `Month YYYY-MM.md` (e.g., `Month 2026-08.md`)
